# ccache's cache directory. `hendrikmuhs/ccache-action` puts it at the root of the checkout
# (`ccache --set-config=cache_dir=$GITHUB_WORKSPACE/.ccache`), and the plan-selection audit counts
# every file git would add -- 1394 cache objects then read as a file class no rule selects.
